WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.379 --> 00:00:14.978
He checks the control panel, then leaves the chamber area.

2
00:00:22.678 --> 00:00:28.367
The person in a black shirt and blue gloves handles a white cable and black object near the chamber window.

3
00:00:33.977 --> 00:00:38.028
He reaches in again with both gloved hands to adjust the plants.

4
00:00:45.275 --> 00:00:51.649
The person in a black shirt and blue gloves operates the control panel and steps back, exiting the frame.

5
00:00:56.574 --> 00:01:01.114
A harvested red chili pepper appears on a black board labeled WEST INDIAN.

6
00:01:07.873 --> 00:01:12.250
The person presses the pepper flat, then photographs it with a black camera.

7
00:01:24.124 --> 00:01:28.489
Crew members gather, passing the small green plant for close inspection.
